 ॥","translit_en":"jo manmukh teerath teh aayo ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਜੋ ਮਨਮੁਖ ਉਸ ਤੀਰਥ ਉਤੇ ਆਇਆ,"}}},{"verse_id":114619,"page_no":896,"line_no":114619,"gurmukhi":"ਪਾਗ ਬਿਨਾ ਕਰਿ ਤਾਹਿ ਪਠਾਯੋ ॥੭॥","translit_en":"paag binaa kar taeh paThaayo ||7||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Any apostate who came on pilgrimage, he was sent back without the turban.(7)"},"pu":{"ss":"ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਪਗ ਤੋਂ ਵਾਝਿਆ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਪਰਤਾਇਆ ॥੭॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":10333,"next":10335}}